@startuml
title Heima v3 - Support, Learning, and Delivery Governance
left to right direction

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam ArrowColor #3C4043
skinparam componentBorderColor #3C4043
skinparam packageBorderColor #80868B

package "Foundation slice" {
  component "Layer 0\nPersistence, retention coverage,\nTiming, runtime health" as L0 #E6F4EA
  component "Layer 1\nHouseFact, Provenance,\nLocation, Zone, Topology" as L1 #E6F4EA
}

component "Layer 2\nstaged registry generation\nSensors, FusionRules, Actuators" as L2 #E6F4EA
component "Layer 3\nhistorical learning, artifacts,\nfindings, signals, candidates" as L3 #E6F4EA
component "Layer 4 - future\nDomain DAG\nauthorized signal consumer" as L4 #FCE8E6
component "Layer 5\ncandidate review, configured policy,\naction admissibility" as L5 #E6F4EA
component "Layer 6 - future\nAvailabilityEpisodeTracker\nnotification delivery" as L6 #FCE8E6

L0 --> L3 : bounded fact-history reads\nand runtime-health snapshot
L2 -[#1A73E8,dashed]-> L3 : staged registry generation
L1 -[#1A73E8,dashed]-> L3 : immutable fact and location contracts

L3 --> L4 : one authorized, expiring\nInferenceSignal
L3 --> L5 : LearningProposalCandidate\nfor independent validation and review

L3 --> L6 : typed suppression occurrence
L5 --> L6 : typed suppression occurrence
L6 --> L0 : sole producer of\nautomation.availability event fact

note bottom of L3
  Slow path only: no HA runtime reads,
  no hot-path blocking I/O, no direct action.
end note

note bottom of L5
  Candidate kind/version and template payload
  are validated independently. Learning proposes;
  policy review and action authority stay here.
end note

note bottom of L6
  The tracker is transient. It reconciles active
  suppression episodes at a publication-generation swap.
  Only Layer 6 renders, delivers, and audits availability.
end note

legend bottom
  |= Color |= Meaning |
  |<#E6F4EA> | Defined layer |
  |<#FCE8E6> | Future layer with fixed interface |
  | Solid arrow | Typed data or operational hand-off |
  | <color:#1A73E8>Blue dashed arrow</color> | Immutable contract or staging dependency |
endlegend
@enduml
